\r\n│ Channel              │ stable (default)                                                                              │\r\n│ Update               │ pnpm · up to date · npm latest 2026.4.9                                                       │\r\n│ Gateway              │ local · ws://127.0.0.1:18789 (local loopback) · [38;5;78mreachable 154ms[39m · auth token · cloud-vps-     │\r\n│                      │ 271125-8476 (103.173.66.241) app 2026.4.9 linux 5.15.0-67-generic                             │\r\n│ Gateway self         │ cloud-vps-271125-8476 (103.173.66.241) app 2026.4.9 linux 5.15.0-67-generic                   │\r\n│ Gateway service      │ systemd not installed                                                                         │\r\n│ Node service         │ systemd not installed                                                                         │\r\n│ Agents               │ 1 · 1 bootstrap file present · sessions 1 · default main active just now                      │\r\n│ Memory               │ [38;5;138menabled (plugin memory-core) · unavailable[39m                                                    │\r\n│ Plugin compatibility │ [38;5;78mnone[39m                                                                                          │\r\n│ Probes               │ [38;5;138mskipped (use --deep)[39m                                                                          │\r\n│ Events               │ none                                                                                          │\r\n│ Tasks                │ [38;5;138mnone[39m                                                                                          │\r\n│ Heartbeat            │ 30m (main)                                                                                    │\r\n│ Sessions             │ 1 active · default gpt-4o (200k ctx) · ~/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json         │\r\n└──────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────