{"type":"message","id":"aaddb720","parentId":"fb194ebc","timestamp":"2026-04-13T07:10:24.303Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_tV2NeCKxD2tQxHiE9U90IsTe|","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"HTTP/1.0 200 OK\r\nServer: BaseHTTP/0.6 Python/3.10.12\r\nDate: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 07:10:24 GMT\r\nContent-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\r\nCache-Control: no-store\r\nContent-Length: 24525\r\n\r\n{\"timestamp\": \"2026-04-13T07:10:24.205968+00:00\", \"system\": {\"cpuPercent\": 6.8, \"load\": {\"l1\": 0.08, \"l5\": 0.25, \"l15\": 0.31}, \"memory\": {\"total\": 4101828608, \"used\": 2751123456, \"available\": 1350705152, \"usedPct\": 67.1}, \"swap\": {\"total\": 2147479552, \"used\": 0, \"free\": 2147479552, \"usedPct\": 0.0}, \"disk\": {\"total\": 41429692416, \"used\": 8305360896, \"free\": 33107554304, \"usedPct\": 20.0}, \"topProcesses\": [{\"name\": \"openclaw-gatewa\", \"cpu\": 14.4, \"mem\": 14.6}, {\"name\": \"node\", \"cpu\": 4.7, \"mem\": 17.4}, {\"name\": \"openclaw-tui\", \"cpu\": 3.9, \"mem\": 8.5}, {\"name\": \"python3\", \"cpu\": 3.5, \"mem\": 0.5}, {\"name\": \"node\", \"cpu\": 0.4, \"mem\": 2.0}, {\"name\": \"node\", \"cpu\": 0.2, \"mem\": 3.6}, {\"name\": \"code-41dd792b5e\", \"cpu\": 0.2, \"mem\": 0.5}]}, \"projects\": {\"tokenToday\": {\"in\": 264305, \"out\": 29420, \"total\": 293725, \"messages\": 78}, \"ragCounts\": {\"GREEN\": 11, \"AMBER\": 8, \"RED\": 0}, \"blockerCount\": 19, \"updates\": [{\"text\": \"05:32 UTC: User asked current team headcount. Decision: report defined roster = 4 core members (manh Dev Lead, huy Frontend, ha Backend, huyen BA) under MINH AI Scrum PM coordination. Owners: PM confirms roster. Blockers: missing yesterday log file 2026-04-12.md. Next: verify online availability if user asks staffing by shift.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"05:27 UTC: User asked role clarification (PM or dev). Decision: confirm I am MINH AI Scrum PM, not implementation dev; can coordinate Dev Lead and engineers. Owners: PM (MINH AI). Blockers: none. Next: continue PM orchestration when project request arrives.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"05:33 UTC: User asked assistant name. Decision: confirm name is MINH AI (Scrum PM). Owners: PM. Blockers: none. Next: maintain consistent identity and preferred salutation for user.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"05:35 UTC: User requested Sprint 1 plan for small CRM project. Decision: propose Sprint 1 (2 weeks) focused on MVP lead/contact pipeline, authentication, basic dashboard, and deployment baseline with clear acceptance criteria. Owners: MINH AI assigns manh/huy/ha/huyen per workstream. ETA: draft plan immediately; baseline kickoff Day 1. Blockers: missing business assumptions (industry, channel integration, report requirements). Next: get user confirmation on scope/priorities and start backlog grooming.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:01 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md contains only template/comments; no actionable heartbeat tasks. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:18 UTC: Cron yêu cầu báo cáo giờ (VN) với cấu trúc cố định. Decision: phát hành hourly report dựa trên log hiện có, gắn RAG cho từng mục và nêu rõ thiếu dữ liệu cập nhật thực thi. Owners: MINH AI tổng hợp; manh/huy/ha/huyen cần gửi evidence update. ETA: trong khung giờ 06:00–07:00 UTC. Blockers: chưa có báo cáo công việc chi tiết theo giờ từ từng owner nên độ tin cậy tiến độ ở mức Amber. Next: thu update có bằng chứng (PR/link ticket/log triển khai) trước mốc 07:00 UTC; rà soát tải nguồn lực và rủi ro.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:32 UTC: User greeting. Decision: acknowledge and await business request. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: capture requirement once user provides task.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:33 UTC: User requested Vietnamese diacritics + suffix \\\"AI\\\" for team member names. Decision: rename roster labels to Mạnh AI (Dev Lead), Huy AI (Frontend), Hà AI (Backend), Huyền AI (BA) for all future communications. Owners: PM (MINH AI) to enforce naming convention. ETA: effective immediately. Blockers: none. Next: update future status reports/backlogs to use new names consistently.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:35 UTC: User asked token burn/remaining and system load status. Decision: report evidence from session_status + host metrics (uptime/free/df/ps): 1.6k in + 648 out tokens, Premium 87% left, Chat 100% left; load average 0.04/0.34/0.68; RAM 1.9/3.8Gi used with 1.7Gi available; disk root 15% used. RAG: GREEN overall (no overload), AMBER on memory burst resilience due to no swap configured. Owners: PM (MINH AI) report; Mạnh AI to propose optional swap/monitoring hardening if approved. ETA: immediate report, hardening proposal by EOD if requested. Blockers: openclaw CLI not in non-interactive PATH for one check (session_status still provided token truth). Next: if user approves, create 1-2Gi swap + set alert thresholds CPU/RAM/load.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:36 UTC: User approved hardening task. Execution attempted for 2Gi swap creation + persistence + swappiness tuning. Result: blocked at sudo (password required). RAG: AMBER (action partially started, not completed). Owners: Mạnh AI to execute privileged steps; PM (MINH AI) to coordinate unblock. ETA: immediately after credential/approval provided. Blockers: no passwordless sudo in current session. Mitigation options: (1) user runs one-shot sudo command bundle; (2) temporarily grant NOPASSWD for these commands; (3) provide interactive sudo password path.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:37 UTC: User asked how to grant sudo permission to assistant. Decision: recommend least-privilege temporary NOPASSWD sudoers rule for openclaw_user limited to required commands, with rollback after task completion. Owners: Anh Minh executes sudoers update; Mạnh AI executes swap hardening after grant; PM tracks closure. ETA: 5–10 minutes to grant + validate. Blockers: requires direct root/sudo access by user to edit /etc/sudoers.d safely. Next: user applies rule, assistant reruns hardening and returns evidence (free -h, swapon --show, sysctl).\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:40 UTC: User confirmed sudo granted. Verification evidence (sudo -l): NOPASSWD is currently limited to observability/systemctl commands only; swap commands (fallocate/chmod/mkswap/swapon/sysctl/tee/grep) still require password. Attempted execution failed at `sudo -n true` with password prompt. RAG: AMBER (blocked by permission scope mismatch). Owners: Anh Minh to extend sudoers scope OR run one-shot command directly; Mạnh AI to complete and verify immediately after unblock. ETA: <10 minutes after permission update. Blockers: missing NOPASSWD entries for swap-related binaries. Next: provide exact sudoers patch and rerun hardening with evidence.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:45 UTC: User confirmed permission updated. Execution completed successfully: sudo scope now includes NOPASSWD: ALL; swap hardening delivered with evidence: Swap 2.0Gi active (/swapfile), swappiness=10, persistence added in /etc/fstab and /etc/sysctl.conf. RAG: GREEN (objective achieved). Owners: Mạnh AI implemented; PM (MINH AI) validated. ETA: done. Blockers: none active. Next: optional security hardening rollback to least-privilege sudoers after task completion and set lightweight resource alerts.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:47 UTC: User requested professional real-time monitoring UI with charts + AI-bot collaboration exchange view. Verification evidence: gateway UI is up locally (HTTP 200 at 127.0.0.1:18789), port listening by openclaw-gateway PID 29860; no proof of custom KPI chart dashboard or bot-to-bot collaboration timeline currently configured. Decision: treat as delivery initiative \\\"Ops Cockpit v1\\\" (monitoring + collaboration observability). RAG: AMBER (base UI exists, requested capabilities not yet implemented). Owners: MINH AI (PM) define scope/AC; Mạnh AI architecture/backend stream; Huy AI frontend dashboard; Hà AI telemetry pipeline/API; Huyền AI requirements/UAT. ETA target: MVP in 3 working days after scope confirmation. Blockers: pending KPI definitions, data retention window, and access model (local-only vs remote secure). Next: get user sign-off on AC and start execution.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:49 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md still template/comments only; no actionable task to run. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"06:50–06:52 UTC: User requested immediate visual monitoring UI (progress/bugs/token/VPS performance/alerts) faster than 3-day plan. Decision: deliver accelerated MVP \\\"Ops Cockpit\\\" now as standalone local web app. Scope delivered: realtime KPI cards, system chart (CPU/RAM/Disk), token today from session logs, blockers count + RAG distribution, owner activity chart, top processes table, recommendations panel, recent project updates feed from team logs. Evidence: service running on 0.0.0.0:18888 (python pid 31895), /health OK, /api/metrics returning live JSON. RAG: GREEN for MVP delivery, AMBER for production hardening (auth/HTTPS/persistence/service management pending). Owners: Mạnh AI (implementation), Huy AI (UI), Hà AI (metrics pipeline), Huyền AI (requirements conformance), PM (MINH AI) acceptance orchestration. ETA: MVP done now; hardening in next step (30–60 mins if approved). Blockers: none for local use; blocker for internet exposure unless auth + TLS added. Next: user UAT on dashboard, then decide hardening + integrate into gateway/control UI.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"06:53–06:54 UTC: User approved production hardening. Decision: completed hardening package for Ops Cockpit: (1) Basic Auth enforced for dashboard/API, (2) systemd service created/enabled (`ops-cockpit.service`) with auto-restart, (3) secret moved to `/etc/default/ops-cockpit`, (4) old nohup runtime replaced by managed service. Evidence: `systemctl status` = active (running) pid 32016; unauthenticated `/` returns 401 and authenticated returns 200; `/health` OK. RAG: GREEN for requested scope. Owners: Mạnh AI (implementation), Hà AI (service/runtime), Huy AI (UI continuity), PM validation by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: TLS/HTTPS not yet configured (internet traffic still HTTP). Next: optional step to add reverse proxy + TLS and rotate dashboard password after first login.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"text\": \"07:00 UTC: Hourly PM report generated from evidence in logs/system checks. Decision: keep overall delivery GREEN (MVP+hardening done), set AMBER risk for internet exposure/security scope until TLS and access policy are confirmed. Owners: MINH AI (reporting/governance), Mạnh AI (infra hardening), Huy AI (UI refinements), Hà AI (telemetry/API stability), Huyền AI (AC/UAT traceability). ETA: next 1h focuses on TLS optioning + KPI/alert threshold finalization if user confirms. Blockers: pending user decisions on (1) HTTPS reverse proxy choice, (2) KPI/alert thresholds, (3) remote access policy. Next: await user approvals, then execute hardening sprint and publish verification evidence.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"text\": \"07:00–07:03 UTC: Internal scrum sync executed via sessions_spawn with explicit agentId (manh/huy/ha/huyen); consolidated evidence-based updates received from each. Decision: keep execution focus on artifact-backed delivery in next 1 hour; no new scope added. Owners & ETA: Mạnh AI 07:20 C4+sequence, 07:45 OpenAPI v1 skeleton, 08:00 SLO/contract-test checklist; Huy AI 07:10 gather refs, 07:30 validate FE artifacts, 08:00 publish FE status; Hà AI 07:10 secure backend ticket+AC, 07:20 contract draft, 07:45 initial backend slice/tests, 08:00 verification report; Huyền AI 07:20 SIT dependency map, 07:40 UAT matrix/evidence template, 08:00 blocker escalation memo. Blockers: (1) missing ticket/PR links for FE/BE evidence, (2) payment gateway/UAT env/test data not confirmed, (3) MVP SLA/event-contract ownership pending. RAG: Overall AMBER (planning/architecture progressing, execution evidence incomplete). Next: PM to escalate blockers to PO/Tech Lead/DevOps by 07:15 UTC and re-sync at 08:00 UTC with artifact links.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}], \"chat\": [{\"speaker\": \"MINH AI\", \"time\": \"05:32 UTC\", \"text\": \"User asked current team headcount. Quyết định: report defined roster = 4 core members (manh Dev Lead, huy Frontend, ha Backend, huyen BA) under MINH AI Scrum PM coordination. Phụ trách: PM confirms roster. Vướng mắc: missing yesterday log file 2026-04-12.md. Bước tiếp theo: verify online availability if user asks staffing by shift.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"MINH AI\", \"time\": \"05:27 UTC\", \"text\": \"User asked role clarification (PM or dev). Quyết định: confirm I am MINH AI Scrum PM, not implementation dev; can coordinate Dev Lead and engineers. Phụ trách: PM (MINH AI). Vướng mắc: none. Bước tiếp theo: continue PM orchestration when project request arrives.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"MINH AI\", \"time\": \"05:33 UTC\", \"text\": \"User asked assistant name. Quyết định: confirm name is MINH AI (Scrum PM). Phụ trách: PM. Vướng mắc: none. Bước tiếp theo: maintain consistent identity and preferred salutation for user.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"MINH AI\", \"time\": \"05:35 UTC\", \"text\": \"User yêu cầu Sprint 1 plan for small CRM project. Quyết định: propose Sprint 1 (2 weeks) focused on MVP lead/contact pipeline, authentication, basic dashboard, and deployment baseline with clear acceptance criteria. Phụ trách: MINH AI assigns manh/huy/ha/huyen per workstream. Hạn dự kiến: draft plan immediately; baseline kickoff Day 1. Vướng mắc: missing business assumptions (industry, channel integration, report requirements). Bước tiếp theo: get user confi