end least-privilege temporary NOPASSWD sudoers rule for openclaw_user limited to required commands, with rollback after task completion. Phụ trách: Anh Minh executes sudoers update; Mạnh AI executes swap hardening after grant; PM tracks closure. Hạn dự kiến: 5–10 minutes to grant + validate. Vướng mắc: requires direct root/sudo access by user to edit /etc/sudoers.d safely. Bước tiếp theo: user applies rule, assistant reruns hardening and returns evidence (free -h, swapon --show, sysctl).\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"06:40 UTC\", \"text\": \"User confirmed sudo granted. Verification evidence (sudo -l): NOPASSWD is currently limited to observability/systemctl commands only; swap commands (fallocate/chmod/mkswap/swapon/sysctl/tee/grep) still require password. Attempted execution failed at `sudo -n true` with password prompt. RAG: AMBER (blocked by permission scope mismatch). Phụ trách: Anh Minh to extend sudoers scope OR run one-shot command directly; Mạnh AI to complete and verify immediately after unblock. Hạn dự kiến: <10 minutes after permission update. Vướng mắc: missing NOPASSWD entries for swap-related binaries. Bước tiếp theo: provide exact sudoers patch and rerun hardening with evidence.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"06:45 UTC\", \"text\": \"User confirmed permission updated. Thực thi hoàn tất thành công: sudo scope now includes NOPASSWD: ALL; swap hardening delivered with evidence: Swap 2.0Gi active (/swapfile), swappiness=10, persistence added in /etc/fstab and /etc/sysctl.conf. RAG: GREEN (objective achieved). Phụ trách: Mạnh AI implemented; PM (MINH AI) validated. Hạn dự kiến: done. Vướng mắc: none active. Bước tiếp theo: optional security hardening rollback to least-privilege sudoers after task completion and set lightweight resource alerts.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"06:47 UTC\", \"text\": \"User yêu cầu professional real-time monitoring UI with charts + AI-bot collaboration exchange view. Verification evidence: gateway UI is up locally (HTTP 200 at 127.0.0.1:18789), port listening by openclaw-gateway PID 29860; no proof of custom KPI chart dashboard or bot-to-bot collaboration timeline currently configured. Quyết định: treat as delivery initiative \\\"Ops Cockpit v1\\\" (monitoring + collaboration observability). RAG: AMBER (base UI exists, yêu cầu capabilities not yet implemented). Phụ trách: MINH AI (PM) define scope/AC; Mạnh AI architecture/backend stream; Huy AI frontend dashboard; Hà AI telemetry pipeline/API; Huyền AI requirements/UAT. ETA target: MVP in 3 working days after scope confirmation. Vướng mắc: đang chờ KPI definitions, data retention window, and access model (local-only vs remote secure). Bước tiếp theo: get user sign-off on AC and start execution.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"speaker\": \"MINH AI\", \"time\": \"06:49 UTC\", \"text\": \"Heartbeat check request. Quyết định: HEARTBEAT.md still template/comments only; no actionable task to run. Phụ trách: PM (MINH AI). Hạn dự kiến: immediate. Vướng mắc: none. Bước tiếp theo: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"06:50–06:52 UTC\", \"text\": \"User yêu cầu immediate visual monitoring UI (progress/bugs/token/VPS performance/alerts) faster than 3-day plan. Quyết định: deliver accelerated MVP \\\"Ops Cockpit\\\" now as standalone local web app. Scope delivered: realtime KPI cards, system chart (CPU/RAM/Disk), token today from session logs, blockers count + RAG distribution, owner activity chart, top processes table, recommendations panel, recent project updates feed from team logs. Bằng chứng: dịch vụ đang chạy on 0.0.0.0:18888 (python pid 31895), /health OK, /api/metrics returning live JSON. RAG: GREEN for MVP delivery, AMBER for production hardening (auth/HTTPS/persistence/service management đang chờ). Phụ trách: Mạnh AI (implementation), Huy AI (UI), Hà AI (metrics pipeline), Huyền AI (requirements conformance), PM (MINH AI) acceptance orchestration. Hạn dự kiến: MVP done now; hardening in next step (30–60 mins if đã phê duyệt). Vướng mắc: none for local use; blocker for internet exposure unless auth + TLS added. Bước tiếp theo: user UAT on dashboard, then decide hardening + integrate into gateway/control UI.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"06:53–06:54 UTC\", \"text\": \"User đã phê duyệt production hardening. Quyết định: completed hardening package for Ops Cockpit: (1) Basic Auth enforced for dashboard/API, (2) systemd service created/enabled (`ops-cockpit.service`) with auto-restart, (3) secret moved to `/etc/default/ops-cockpit`, (4) old nohup runtime replaced by managed service. Bằng chứng: `systemctl status` = active (running) pid 32016; unauthenticated `/` returns 401 and authenticated returns 200; `/health` OK. RAG: GREEN for yêu cầu scope. Phụ trách: Mạnh AI (implementation), Hà AI (service/runtime), Huy AI (UI continuity), PM validation by MINH AI. Hạn dự kiến: done now. Vướng mắc: TLS/HTTPS not yet configured (internet traffic still HTTP). Bước tiếp theo: optional step to add reverse proxy + TLS and rotate dashboard password after first login.\", \"rag\": \"GREEN\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"07:00 UTC\", \"text\": \"Hourly PM report generated from evidence in logs/system checks. Quyết định: keep overall delivery GREEN (MVP+hardening done), set AMBER risk for internet exposure/security scope until TLS and access policy are confirmed. Phụ trách: MINH AI (reporting/governance), Mạnh AI (infra hardening), Huy AI (UI refinements), Hà AI (telemetry/API stability), Huyền AI (AC/UAT traceability). Hạn dự kiến: next 1h focuses on TLS optioning + KPI/alert threshold finalization if user confirms. Vướng mắc: đang chờ user decisions on (1) HTTPS reverse proxy choice, (2) KPI/alert thresholds, (3) remote access policy. Bước tiếp theo: await user approvals, then execute hardening sprint and publish verification evidence.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}, {\"speaker\": \"Mạnh AI\", \"time\": \"07:00–07:03 UTC\", \"text\": \"Internal scrum sync executed via sessions_spawn with explicit agentId (manh/huy/ha/huyen); consolidated evidence-based updates received from each. Quyết định: keep execution focus on artifact-backed delivery in next 1 hour; no new scope added. Owners & Hạn dự kiến: Mạnh AI 07:20 C4+sequence, 07:45 OpenAPI v1 skeleton, 08:00 SLO/contract-test checklist; Huy AI 07:10 gather refs, 07:30 validate FE artifacts, 08:00 publish FE status; Hà AI 07:10 secure backend ticket+AC, 07:20 contract draft, 07:45 initial backend slice/tests, 08:00 verification report; Huyền AI 07:20 SIT dependency map, 07:40 UAT matrix/evidence template, 08:00 blocker escalation memo. Vướng mắc: (1) missing ticket/PR links for FE/BE evidence, (2) payment gateway/UAT env/test data not confirmed, (3) MVP SLA/event-contract ownership đang chờ. RAG: Overall AMBER (planning/architecture progressing, execution evidence incomplete). Bước tiếp theo: PM to escalate blockers to PO/Tech Lead/DevOps by 07:15 UTC and re-sync at 08:00 UTC with artifact links.\", \"rag\": \"AMBER\"}], \"ownerActivity\": {\"Mạnh AI\": 11, \"Huy AI\": 6, \"Hà AI\": 6, \"Huyền AI\": 5, \"MINH AI\": 16}}, \"recommendations\": [\"Có 19 mục blocker trong log gần nhất: ưu tiên xử lý ngay.\"]}","cwd":"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776064224289}}
