wners: Huy AI (frontend), Hà AI (payload continuity), Mạnh AI (deployment/restart), PM acceptance MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: none. Next: user validates on mobile; if needed add persistent preference (remember collapsed state per browser).\n- 07:18–07:22 UTC: User requested reports to be 100% Vietnamese with minimal English. Decision: implemented language-hardening pass v3 in backend formatter: normalized additional English terms to Vietnamese, restructured technical detail output into Vietnamese bullet template, added fallback simplification for high-English fragments, and updated UI labels previously in English. Evidence: API sample now returns Vietnamese preview/detail fields; service restarted successfully after patch. RAG: GREEN (language requirement substantially met), AMBER for residual edge cases from legacy mixed-content strings. Owners: Hà AI (text normalization rules), Huy AI (UI wording), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM acceptance by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: heuristic mapping may still produce rare awkward phrases on old log entries. Next: collect 3–5 problematic lines from user and tune dictionary for final polish.\n- 07:20–07:21 UTC: User requested token-limit conversion (% remaining) and cost conversion to VND with thousands separators (e.g., 1,000,000). Decision: added new KPI cards for token budget remaining % + absolute remaining tokens and cost estimates in VND/USD; backend now computes `tokenBudget` and `costEstimate` from token usage with configurable pricing/env rates, frontend formats numbers with comma separators. Evidence: API returns `tokenBudget` + `costEstimate` objects; UI contains cards \"Hạn mức token còn lại\" and \"Chi phí ước tính (VND)\"; service restarted and verified. RAG: GREEN (feature delivered). Owners: Hà AI (calculation/API), Huy AI (UI + formatting), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: displayed cost is estimate only, depends on configured rate assumptions. Next: align exac