{"type":"message","id":"d25cb26e","parentId":"9bf0bb2a","timestamp":"2026-04-13T08:00:21.900Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Mj61kFshK0qGe95JfOrQeRxv|","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 39 - 07:33–07:35 UTC: User requested priority blockers to be surfaced from overview down to detailed context for decision support. Decision: added dedicated overview-to-detail blocker module: backend now computes `priorityBlockers` (severity-tagged RED/AMBER, top 8) from log blocker fields; UI now renders `🚨 Vướng mắc ưu tiên xử lý` section with concise summary + `Xem thêm bối cảnh` to reveal source and raw detail. Evidence: API returns `priorityBlockers` and `blockerCount` aligns with prioritized list; dashboard includes new blocker section and detail toggle; service restarted successfully. RAG: GREEN (decision-support visibility delivered). Owners: Hà AI (priority extraction/scoring), Huy AI (overview-detail UI), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: blocker raw text still partly mixed-language from historical logs. Next: normalize blocker raw text to full Vietnamese in next refinement pass.\n 40 - 07:54 UTC: User requested hide/show control for blocker section. Decision: added section-level toggle button for blocker module (`Ẩn mục này` / `Hiện mục này`) similar to updates panel for cleaner scrolling control. Evidence: `toggleBlockers(...)` function added and bound to `toggleBlockersBtn`; service restarted and HTML verification confirms control present. RAG: GREEN (UX request delivered). Owners: Huy AI (frontend toggle), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: none. Next: optional persist collapsed state in browser localStorage if user wants sticky preference.\n 41 - 07:21 UTC: Heartbeat check request received with system status context. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md contains only template/comments and no actionable heartbeat tasks; ignore prior context per instruction. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\n 42 - 07:51 UTC: Heartbeat check request. Decision: HEARTBEAT.md unchanged (template/comments only), so no action required. Owners: PM (MINH AI). ETA: immediate. Blockers: none. Next: return HEARTBEAT_OK.\n+43 - 07:59 UTC: User requested ChatGPT-like voice conversation with MINH AI. Decision: feasible but currently blocked by browser microphone security because dashboard is served over HTTP public IP (Web Speech/mic requires secure context HTTPS or localhost). Proposed delivery plan \"Voice Mode Lite\": push-to-talk STT + TTS playback + conversation transcript in dashboard after HTTPS is enabled. RAG: AMBER (clear path, one infra blocker). Owners: Mạnh AI (HTTPS/reverse proxy), Huy AI (voice UI controls), Hà AI (voice pipeline endpoint/session relay), Huyền AI (UAT scenarios). ETA: ~2 hours after approval + domain/HTTPS path confirmed. Blockers: no HTTPS endpoint/domain configured yet. Next: get user approval on HTTPS method (domain + TLS or Tailscale/localhost) then execute implementation sprint.\n 43 ","firstChangedLine":43},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776067221897}}
{"type":"message","id":"0a72b0c5","parentId":"d25cb26e","timestamp":"2026-04-13T08:00:30.915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Anh Minh làm được nhé — và em ủng hộ triển khai luôn 👍\n\nHiện trạng thực tế:\n- Ý tưởng **voice hội thoại như ChatGPT** là khả thi.\n- Nhưng dashboard của mình đang chạy qua **HTTP** (IP public), nên bị chặn quyền mic trên trình duyệt.\n- Muốn dùng voice ổn định, cần **HTTPS** trước.\n\n### Kế hoạch triển khai (ngắn gọn)\n**Mục tiêu kinh doanh:** anh nói chuyện trực tiếp với MINH AI bằng giọng nói để trao đổi nhanh.\n\n**Phạm vi Voice Mode Lite:**\n1. Nút **Giữ để nói** / **Bấm để nói**\n2. Chuyển giọng nói thành text (STT)\n3. MINH AI phản hồi bằng text + đọc giọng (TTS)\n4. Lưu transcript trong dashboard\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Mic hoạt động trên trình duyệt (HTTPS)\n- Vòng phản hồi voice→text→AI→voice < 3s cho câu ngắn\n- Có nút bật/tắt voice, mute, chọn giọng đọc\n- Có log hội thoại để xem lại\n\n### Phân công\n- **Mạnh AI**: HTTPS/reverse proxy\n- **Huy AI**: UI voice controls\n- **Hà AI**: luồng STT/TTS + session relay\n- **Huyền AI**: kịch bản test/UAT\n- **MINH AI**: điều phối và nghiệm thu\n\n### ETA\n- **~2 giờ** sau khi anh chốt cách HTTPS.\n\n---\n\nNếu anh đồng ý, em bắt đầu ngay.  \nAnh chọn 1 trong 2 cách:\n1. **Domain + TLS (khuyên dùng)**  \n2. **Tailscale/localhost secure context** (nhanh nội bộ)","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":514,"output":386,"cacheRead":145792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":146692,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776067221916,"responseId":""}}
