{"type":"message","id":"5cbd03dc","parentId":"2146da5a","timestamp":"2026-04-13T08:06:47.396Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_BOTlo0MvglbBtxhtS4rVVe99|","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md","edits":[{"oldText":"- 08:02–08:04 UTC: User approved immediate delivery and requested ChatGPT-like conversation mode with Vietnamese female voice and polite address style. Decision: implemented Voice Mode Lite in dashboard now: (1) voice control panel, (2) browser speech recognition (`vi-VN`) push-to-talk, (3) MINH AI response endpoint `/api/minh-chat`, (4) TTS playback preferring Vietnamese female voice, (5) polite response persona in reply generator, (6) in-panel transcript log for turn-by-turn exchange. Evidence: HTML contains voice controls (`Bắt đầu hội thoại`, `Giữ để nói`), JS hooks for SpeechRecognition + TTS + askMinh flow, API call test returned polite Vietnamese response with formatted token/cost numbers. RAG: GREEN (core experience delivered), AMBER for browser/HTTPS dependency on microphone in some environments. Owners: Huy AI (voice UI), Hà AI (voice API + persona logic), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: microphone capture may fail on non-HTTPS context depending browser policy. Next: if user confirms domain, execute HTTPS enablement to stabilize voice capture across devices.\n","newText":"- 08:02–08:04 UTC: User approved immediate delivery and requested ChatGPT-like conversation mode with Vietnamese female voice and polite address style. Decision: implemented Voice Mode Lite in dashboard now: (1) voice control panel, (2) browser speech recognition (`vi-VN`) push-to-talk, (3) MINH AI response endpoint `/api/minh-chat`, (4) TTS playback preferring Vietnamese female voice, (5) polite response persona in reply generator, (6) in-panel transcript log for turn-by-turn exchange. Evidence: HTML contains voice controls (`Bắt đầu hội thoại`, `Giữ để nói`), JS hooks for SpeechRecognition + TTS + askMinh flow, API call test returned polite Vietnamese response with formatted token/cost numbers. RAG: GREEN (core experience delivered), AMBER for browser/HTTPS dependency on microphone in some environments. Owners: Huy AI (voice UI), Hà AI (voice API + persona logic), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: microphone capture may fail on non-HTTPS context depending browser policy. Next: if user confirms domain, execute HTTPS enablement to stabilize voice capture across devices.\n- 08:04–08:06 UTC: User requested HTTPS upgrade and approved execution now. Decision: upgraded Ops Cockpit service to native HTTPS (TLS) mode using self-signed certificate on port 18888; service unit switched to HTTPS profile, certificate/key generated under `/etc/ssl/ops-cockpit`, permissions fixed for runtime access, service restarted healthy. Evidence: `ops-cockpit.service` active (running) with HTTPS profile; `curl -k https://127.0.0.1:18888/` returns HTTP 200 with auth. RAG: GREEN (HTTPS enabled), AMBER for trust UX because self-signed cert will show browser warning until domain CA cert is installed. Owners: Mạnh AI (TLS infra), Hà AI (runtime fixes), Huy AI (voice validation on secure context), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: browser certificate warning (self-signed). Next: if user provides domain, issue trusted TLS cert (Let’s Encrypt) to remove warning and finalize production-grade voice UX.\n"}]},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\",\"edits\":[{\"oldText\":\"- 08:02–08:04 UTC: User approved immediate delivery and requested ChatGPT-like conversation mode with Vietnamese female voice and polite address style. Decision: implemented Voice Mode Lite in dashboard now: (1) voice control panel, (2) browser speech rec