:00 publish FE status; Hà AI 07:10 secure backend ticket+AC, 07:20 contract draft, 07:45 initial backend slice/tests, 08:00 verification report; Huyền AI 07:20 SIT dependency map, 07:40 UAT matrix/evidence template, 08:00 blocker escalation memo. Blockers: (1) missing ticket/PR links for FE/BE evidence, (2) payment gateway/UAT env/test data not confirmed, (3) MVP SLA/event-contract ownership pending. RAG: Overall AMBER (planning/architecture progressing, execution evidence incomplete). Next: PM to escalate blockers to PO/Tech Lead/DevOps by 07:15 UTC and re-sync at 08:00 UTC with artifact links.\n- 07:09–07:10 UTC: User requested bot exchange section to display as chat conversation in Vietnamese. Decision: implemented chat-style panel `💬 Hội thoại nội bộ giữa các bot (Tiếng Việt)` in dashboard; backend now emits `projects.chat` with speaker/time/text/rag derived from logs and Vietnamese label normalization. Evidence: service restarted successfully (`ops-cockpit.service` active pid 34879), `/api/metrics` includes populated `projects.chat` entries, UI updated in `public/index.html`. RAG: GREEN (feature delivered). Owners: Huy AI (UI), Hà AI (API payload), Mạnh AI (integration), PM validation by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: semantic translation still rule-based (not full NLP), may need refinement for cleaner Vietnamese phrasing. Next: collect user feedback on conversation tone and adjust mapping rules.\n- 07:12 UTC: User requested hiding technical content by default with per-message expand button; bot-to-bot communication must stay Vietnamese. Decision: updated chat payload to split `text` (non-technical preview) and `detail` (technical block), and UI now adds `Xem thêm chi tiết kỹ thuật` button in each message to toggle hidden detail inline. Evidence: backend functions `summarize_non_technical_vi` + `extract_technical_details_vi` added; frontend renders toggle button and collapsible detail; service restarted successfully and API returns `text/detail` fields. RAG: