ốc thời gian cụ thể), (4) Risk level (GREEN/AMBER/RED + lý do). Nếu thiếu dữ liệu thì nói rõ thiếu gì.\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": 1776067300096,\\n      \\\"__openclaw\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"261f4e33\\\",\\n        \\\"seq\\\": 1\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"assistant\\\",\\n      \\\"content\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"thinking\\\",\\n          \\\"thinking\\\": \\\"\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"toolCall\\\",\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"call_yVPb9Ip5iNAomOYiPK488FpT|\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"read\\\",\\n          \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n            \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace-manh/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\\\"\\n          },\\n          \\\"partialJson\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace-manh/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"toolCall\\\",\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"call_VJxH4ogJ6QAPCZ7IMvZhawT8|\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"read\\\",\\n          \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n            \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace-manh/team_logs/2026-04-12.md\\\"\\n          },\\n          \\\"partialJson\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace-manh/team_logs/2026-04-12.md\\\\\\\"}\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"api\\\": \\\"openai-responses\\\",\\n      \\\"provider\\\": \\\"github-copilot\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.3-codex\\\",\\n      \\\"stopReason\\\": \\\"toolUse\\\",\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": 1776067300111,\\n      \\\"responseId\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"__openclaw\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"27bfc6fe\\\",\\n        \\\"seq\\\": 2\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"toolResult\\\",\\n      \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"call_yVPb9Ip5iNAomOYiPK488FpT|\\\",\\n      \\\"toolName\\\": \\\"read\\\",\\n      \\\"content\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\",\\n          \\\"text\\\": \\\"# Daily Log 2026-04-13\\\\n\\\\n## Summary\\\\n- Đã đề xuất kiến trúc microservice cho CRM theo hướng domain-driven và event-driven hybrid.\\\\n\\\\n## Decisions\\\\n- Tách bounded context: Customer, Lead, Opportunity, Activity, Communication, AuthZ.\\\\n- Dùng API Gateway + OAuth2/OIDC + mTLS nội bộ.\\\\n- Data per service (PostgreSQL), event bus (Kafka/RabbitMQ) cho tích hợp và đồng bộ eventual consistency.\\\\n\\\\n## Tasks\\\\n- Xác nhận ưu tiên MVP (Lead/Customer/Activity) và SLA theo từng API.\\\\n- Chuẩn hóa schema event (versioned envelope + idempotency key).\\\\n- Thiết kế chiến lược migration từ monolith/legacy CRM (nếu có).\\\\n\\\\n## Risks\\\\n- Rủi ro phân mảnh dữ liệu và truy vấn liên domain nếu không có read model.\\\\n- Rủi ro duplicate event/at-least-once delivery gây sai lệch trạng thái pipeline.\\\\n- Rủi ro quá tách nhỏ service giai đoạn đầu làm tăng vận hành.\\\\n\\\\n## Next\\\\n- Chốt C4 level 2 + sequence cho luồng Lead->Opportunity.\\\\n- Tạo API contract OpenAPI v1 và bộ contract test.\\\\n- Thiết lập SLO + dashboard quan sát ban đầu.\\\\n\\\\n## Scrum Sync 07:00 UTC\\\\n### Key outcomes\\\\n- Xác nhận tiến độ: đã có đề xuất kiến trúc microservice CRM theo bounded context + event-driven hybrid.\\\\n- Chốt hướng ưu tiên execution: MVP tập trung Lead/Customer/Activity và chuẩn hóa event envelope versioning.\\\\n\\\\n### Debt\\\\n- Chưa có artifact thực thi (OpenAPI v1, contract test, sequence chi tiết Lead->Opportunity) nên khó verify end-to-end readiness.\\\\n\\\\n### Technical risks\\\\n- Event duplicate/at-least-once chưa có idempotency implementation chi tiết, nguy cơ lệch trạng thái pipeline.\\\\n- Cross-domain query chưa có read-model strategy cụ thể, nguy cơ hiệu năng và tính nhất quán báo cáo.\\\\n\\\\n## Scrum Sync 07:02 UTC\\\\n### Key outcomes\\\\n- Cập nhật scrum 4-field với bằng chứng từ log ngày 2026-04-13 và làm rõ trạng thái AMBER.\\\\n\\\\n### Debt\\\\n- Chưa có PR/ticket ID và output command thực thi để chứng minh tiến độ implementation.\\\\n\\\\n### Technical risks\\\\n- Phụ thuộc quyết định PO/Platform cho MVP SLA và event contract có thể làm trễ bắt đầu build.\\\\n\\\\n\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"isError\\\": false,\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": 1776067312375,\\n      \\\"__openclaw\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"8fca443d\\\",\\n        \\\"seq\\\": 3\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"toolResult\\\",\\n      \\\"toolCallId\\\": \\\"call_VJxH4ogJ6QAPCZ7IMvZhawT8|\\\",\\n      \\\"toolName\\\": \\\"read\\\",\\n      \\\"content\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\",\\n          \\\"text\\\": \\\"# Daily Log 2026-04-12\\\\n\\\\n## Summary\\\\n\\\\n## Decisions\\\\n\\\\n## Tasks\\\\n\\\\n## Risks\\\\n\\\\n## Next\\\\n\\\\n\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"isError\\\": false,\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": 1776067312379,\\n      \\\"__openclaw\\\": {\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"8b126ea6\\\",\\n        \\\"seq\\\": 4\\n      }\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"assistant\\\",\\n      \\\"content\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"thinking\\\",\\n          \\\"thinking\\\": \\\"\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"type\\\": \\\"toolCall\\\",\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"call_klJiCI8lDIqT8wAxYSC9RD7Q|\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"edit\\\",\\n          \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n            \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace-manh/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\\\",\\n            \\\"edits\\\": [\\n              {\\n                \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"## Scrum Sync 07:02 UTC\\\\n### Key outcomes\\\\n- Cập nhật scrum 4-field với bằng chứng từ log ngày 2026-04-13 và làm rõ trạng thái AMBER.\\\\n\\\\n### Debt\\\\n- Chưa có PR/ticket ID và output command thực thi để chứng minh tiến độ implementation.\\\\n\\\\n### Technical risks\\\\n- Phụ thuộc quyết định PO/Platform cho MVP SLA và event contract có thể làm trễ bắt đầu b