wners: Huy AI (frontend), Hà AI (payload continuity), Mạnh AI (deployment/restart), PM acceptance MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: none. Next: user validates on mobile; if needed add persistent preference (remember collapsed state per browser).\n- 07:18–07:22 UTC: User requested reports to be 100% Vietnamese with minimal English. Decision: implemented language-hardening pass v3 in backend formatter: normalized additional English terms to Vietnamese, restructured technical detail output into Vietnamese bullet template, added fallback simplification for high-English fragments, and updated UI labels previously in English. Evidence: API sample now returns Vietnamese preview/detail fields; service restarted successfully after patch. RAG: GREEN (language requirement substantially met), AMBER for residual edge cases from legacy mixed-content strings. Owners: Hà AI (text normalization rules), Huy AI (UI wording), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM acceptance by MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: heuristic mapping may still produce rare awkward phrases on old log entries. Next: collect 3–5 problematic lines from user and tune dictionary for final polish.\n- 07:20–07:21 UTC: User requested token-limit conversion (% remaining) and cost conversion to VND with thousands separators (e.g., 1,000,000). Decision: added new KPI cards for token budget remaining % + absolute remaining tokens and cost estimates in VND/USD; backend now computes `tokenBudget` and `costEstimate` from token usage with configurable pricing/env rates, frontend formats numbers with comma separators. Evidence: API returns `tokenBudget` + `costEstimate` objects; UI contains cards \"Hạn mức token còn lại\" and \"Chi phí ước tính (VND)\"; service restarted and verified. RAG: GREEN (feature delivered). Owners: Hà AI (calculation/API), Huy AI (UI + formatting), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: displayed cost is estimate only, depends on configured rate assumptions. Next: align exact billing rates from provider to improve estimate accuracy.\n- 07:21–07:24 UTC: User reported missing visible conversation lines from Huy/Hà/Huyền bots in Vietnamese chat stream. Decision: improved speaker extraction and owner-split parsing for multi-owner updates; added fallback presence messages to ensure all 4 bots appear in conversation panel when recent logs are sparse. Evidence: API speaker count now includes Huyền AI and other owners in `projects.chat`; service restarted successfully. RAG: GREEN (visibility gap closed), AMBER for semantic richness (fallback lines are generic when source logs lack direct bot quotes). Owners: Hà AI (parser logic), Huy AI (chat rendering continuity), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM validation MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: limited source material from direct bot utterances in current logs. Next: implement structured bot-message source to replace generic fallback with real per-bot dialogue.\n- 07:27–07:29 UTC: User requested (1) bot conversations feel more human-natural and (2) token-used number formatted with comma separators. Decision: updated chat generation with humanized per-owner phrases (`humanize_owner_update`/`humanize_preview`) to reduce robotic tone; changed token-used KPI to formatted display via `fmtNumber(...)` (e.g., 615,148). Evidence: API chat samples now render natural Vietnamese updates for Huy/Hà/Huyền/MINH; frontend binding changed from raw token value to formatted value; service restarted and verified. RAG: GREEN (requirement delivered). Owners: Huy AI (UI formatting), Hà AI (conversation text shaping), Mạnh AI (deploy/restart), PM acceptance MINH AI. ETA: done now. Blockers: a few legacy detail lines can still look template-like in expanded technical view. Next: optional fine-tune detail tone if user asks for even more conversational style.\n- 07:33–07:35 UTC: User requested priority blockers to be surfaced from overview down to detailed context for decision support. Decision: added dedicated overview-to-de