không tạo output kỹ thuật đo được.  \\n- **ETA cần gỡ blocker**: **trước 09:20 UTC** để kịp execution trong giờ này.\\n\\n3) **Kế hoạch 1 giờ tới**  \\n- **09:05–09:20 UTC (Owner: PM/PO + Ha)**: Chốt ticket backend + AC + ưu tiên.  \\n- **09:20–09:40 UTC (Owner: Ha)**: Draft nhanh API contract + data schema + consistency/auth/caching/queue strategy cho ticket được giao.  \\n- **09:40–10:00 UTC (Owner: Ha)**: Tạo implementation plan + test checklist + observability/runbook notes, gửi lại team để approve.  \\n\\n4) **Risk level**  \\n- **AMBER** — vì blocker phân việc chưa được gỡ; nếu không có ticket trước **09:20 UTC** thì rủi ro chuyển **RED** do không đạt tiến độ giờ làm hiện tại.\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-responses\",\"provider\":\"github-copilot\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\",\"usage\":{\"input\":681,\"output\":559,\"cacheRead\":1408,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":2648,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1776071151592,\"responseId\":\"\"}}\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/agents/ha/sessions/6ca9142b-7c44-40c2-9f2a-3e0b69f3ae2f.jsonl:2:{\"type\":\"model_change\",\"id\":\"764a25f6\",\"parentId\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-13T07:02:18.054Z\",\"provider\":\"github-copilot\",\"modelId\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\"}\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/agents/ha/sessions/6ca9142b-7c44-40c2-9f2a-3e0b69f3ae2f.jsonl:4:{\"type\":\"custom\",\"customType\":\"model-snapshot\",\"data\":{\"timestamp\":1776063738071,\"provider\":\"github-copilot\",\"modelApi\":\"openai-responses\",\"modelId\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\"},\"id\":\"5d4b0f2b\",\"parentId\":\"11b4fea7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-13T07:02:18.071Z\"}\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/agents/ha/sessions/6ca9142b-7c44-40c2-9f2a-3e0b69f3ae2f.jsonl:6:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"9d95beb6\",\"parentId\":\"4bbf79de\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-13T07:02:21.642Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"