{"type":"compaction","id":"33030023","parentId":"4e86aa87","timestamp":"2026-04-13T15:46:17.959Z","summary":"## Goal\n- Maintain and operate a Vietnamese-first **Ops Cockpit** dashboard for anh Minh with realtime system/project monitoring, blockers visibility, and direct chat/voice interaction.\n- Deliver high-trust, evidence-based PM orchestration (clear owners, ETA, blockers, RAG).\n- Collect annual financial report data for template banks (**2024 & 2025**, not quarterly), then **fill template accurately**.\n- New operational goal from this segment: provide a **live online progress view** so user can watch fill progress in realtime.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Address user as **“anh Minh”/“sếp”**, polite Vietnamese tone.\n- UI/reports/chat copy should be **Vietnamese-first**.\n- Official periodic report remains **17:00 VN**; however during this task user requested very frequent live updates (2-minute cadence / immediate replies).\n- **Accuracy over speed/cost** for financial extraction and template filling.\n- Scope fixed: annual reports 2024/2025, banks from template only; blocked sources/captcha => **PENDING + reason**.\n- New strict reporting rule agreed:\n  - Separate statuses: **A=Downloaded source, B=Parsed metrics, C=Filled template**.\n  - Only call a bank “done” when **C=DONE**.\n- User requires **exact counts** (no optimistic rounding): distinguish file count vs unique-bank count vs filled-template count.\n- Mapping clarification: **VPB = VPBank**.\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Preserved prior platform work: systemd service, HTTPS self-signed deployment, auth, Vietnamese UX, chat/voice, upload, session/history architecture, weather intent fix, etc.\n- [x] Preserved governance decisions: official 17:00 VN report, blocker-first format, accuracy-first extraction.\n- [x] Financial bootstrap preserved: `openpyxl` installed; 30-bank template parsed; working directory created.\n- [x] Added one more source artifact via search-driven retrieval:\n  - `VCB_EN_VCB-Annual-Report-2024_Full_250426_FN_compressed.pdf`\n  - Current source files: **3** total (TCB x2, VCB x1), unique banks with source: **2**.\n- [x] Produced downloadable progress workbook:\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/ket-qua-tam-thoi-bank-annual-20260413-140510.xlsx`\n  - Shared via `/uploads/...` link.\n- [x] Created realtime WIP tracking workbook:\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/wip-dien-template-realtime.xlsx`\n- [x] Created live online progress page + data feed:\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.html`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.json`\n- [x] Dashboard outage incident handled: detected “active-but-timeout”, restarted `ops-cockpit.service`, `/health` recovered.\n- [x] HEARTBEAT flow followed correctly (`/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md` template-only => `HEARTBEAT_OK`).\n- [x] Durable memory appended (A/B/C definition, trust sensitivity, current checkpoint) in:\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-13.md`\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Core delivery gap remains: convert source PDFs into mapped numeric values and fill template sheets for banks.\n- [ ] Current verified fill status in main sheets (`Bảng cân đối `, `Bảng kết quả kinh doanh`) is still **0 filled cells** for bank rows in delivered temp file.\n- [ ] Hotfix observability for dashboard modules:\n  - “Trao đổi công việc / cập nhật gần nhất”\n  - “💬 Hội thoại nội bộ giữa các bot”\n  to show true recent activity (timestamp/owner freshness).\n\n### Blocked\n- Static scraping still weak on JS-heavy IR pages; robust browser automation not fully operational.\n- Parsing/mapping from long annual-report PDFs to exact template metrics is slow and error-prone (unit/line-item mismatch).\n- Dashboard feed trust issue: `parse_team_updates` currently returns mostly text+RAG, causing missing `time/owner` in many rendered update items.\n- Chat feed can appear stale due fallback/older internal messages (`recent_internal_agent_messages` + synthetic fill-ins).\n- Service reliability risk remains (intermittent “active but socket timeout”); watchdog not yet implemented.\n- Self-signed TLS warning still present for end users.\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **17:00 VN official reporting remains**: periodic governance unchanged; live pings are task-time operational updates.\n- **Accuracy-first extraction**: correctness prioritized over token/cost/time.\n- **Financial scope fixed**: annual 2024/2025, template banks only, blocked sources => PENDING with evidence.\n- **Strict progress semantics (A/B/C)**: only **C=DONE** counts as completed bank.\n- **Exact metrics reporting**: always separate source file count, unique bank count, and filled-template count.\n- **Recovery-first operations for dashboard**: restart service on active-but-timeout incidents; add watchdog next.\n- **Realtime transparency**: provide online progress link (`/uploads/realtime-progress.html`) and WIP file link.\n- **Normalization rule locked**: VPB code maps to VPBank.\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Deliver first true **C=DONE** bank (assistant committed VCB-first), with filled rows in main sheets + source trace.\n2. Continue bank expansion with clear ledger: DONE/PENDING + URL/reason/captcha evidence.\n3. Implement parser/feed hotfix in `ops_cockpit/server.py` (`parse_team_updates` and related render path) to surface real `time/owner` activity.\n4. Improve bot-conversation freshness in `build_chat_messages(...)` / `recent_internal_agent_messages(...)` (dedupe, recency window, stale badge).\n5. Add watchdog/health auto-restart for `ops-cockpit.service` to mitigate active-but-timeout recurrence.\n6. Keep realtime artifacts updated (`realtime-progress.json/html`, WIP xlsx) while preserving exact A/B/C reporting.\n\n## Critical Context\n- Active key files/paths:\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/server.py`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/public/index.html`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-13.md`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/financial_reports_annual_2024_2025`\n  - `/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.html`\n- Current known checkpoint shared to user:\n  - Source files: **3**\n  - Unique banks with source: **2** (TCB, VCB)\n  - Banks filled at C=DONE: **0/30**\n- Service/network context:\n  - `ops-cockpit.service` on `0.0.0.0:18888`\n  - NAT redirect rules include `443 -> 18888`\n  - Auth env observed at `/etc/default/ops-cockpit` (`OPS_COCKPIT_PASS=...`; user defaults in code include `OPS_COCKPIT_USER`).\n- Relevant backend functions examined:\n  - `parse_team_updates(...)`\n  - `build_chat_messages(...)`\n  - `recent_internal_agent_messages(...)`\n- Notable errors/signals seen in this segment:\n  - repeated **LLM idle timeout**\n  - socket/timeouts despite active service (TCP fail before restart)\n  - `HTTP/1.0 501 Unsupported method ('HEAD')` on dashboard handler\n  - earlier preserved errors remain relevant (`missing_gemini_api_key`, `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'openpyxl'`, `/usr/bin/python3: No module named pip`, `json.decoder.JSONDecodeError: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)`).\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\n- User pinged: “alo hết 20 phút rồi xem kết quả nào” (asking to check results after waiting ~20 minutes), in the context of ongoing work on the `ops_cockpit` dashboard/backend.\n\n## Early Progress\n- Assistant inspected `public/index.html` to verify rendered sections and data bindings:\n  - Found updates list uses `d.projects.updatesLight` (not `d.projects.updates`) and renders into `#updates`.\n  - Found chat panel uses `d.projects.chat` and renders into `#chat`.\n  - Confirmed UI label exists: **“💬 Hội thoại nội bộ giữa các bot (Tiếng Việt)”**.\n  - Also searched for other related labels like “Trao đổi công việc”.\n- Assistant inspected `server.py` to understand backend data processing:\n  - Located token-usage aggregation logic (daily input/output totals).\n  - Found `parse_team_updates()` parsing markdown team logs (`- ...` lines) with basic RAG detection (`GREEN/AMBER/RED`).\n  - Found `owner_activity()` counting mentions of specific owner names.\n  - Found `to_vietnamese_text()` mapping common English status fields to Vietnamese.\n- Assistant also checked top-level server config/constants:\n  - Paths for workspace, uploads, team logs, sessions, public dir.\n  - Auth/env settings (`OPS_COCKPIT_USER/PASS`) and token/cost env vars.\n  - Chat session file/lock and OpenClaw binary path.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- The retained suffix continues code-level investigation of `ops_cockpit`, especially how frontend sections (`updates`, `chat`) map to backend-provided fields.\n- Important detail: frontend currently reads **`projects.updatesLight`** for recent updates, so any missing/incorrect data may come from backend payload construction rather than UI rendering loop.\n- Backend has explicit Vietnamese text conversion and team-log parsing, which likely affects what appears in dashboard cards and chat/update summaries.\n\n<read-files>\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-12.md\n~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-13.md\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/ops-cockpit-https.service\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/ops-cockpit.service\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/public/index.html\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/server.py\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.html\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.json\n/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"7e1a6103","tokensBefore":76,"details":{"readFiles":["/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/openclaw.json","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-12.md","~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md"],"modifiedFiles":["/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-13.md","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/ops-cockpit-https.service","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/ops-cockpit.service","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/public/index.html","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/server.py","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.html","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/ops_cockpit/uploads/realtime-progress.json","/home/openclaw_user/.openclaw/workspace/team_logs/2026-04-13.md"]},"fromHook":false}
